    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "The full suite consists of the single `AcceptanceTest` class, and it passes (`BUILD SUCCESS`).\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `telephoneDisplay` \u2014 the stored E.164 telephone formatted for humans \u2014 while keeping `telephone` as raw E.164. Three focused, low-impact changes:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `telephoneDisplay` property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field.\n\n2. **`TelephoneFormatter.java`** (new) \u2014 a small, self-contained utility (same idiom as `AddressNormalizer`, `PostcodeValidator`, etc.) with one static `display` method: splits off the known country code, then groups the national digits in threes \u2192 `+61412345678` becomes `+61 412 345 678`. WMC_other is zero since it's a fresh cohesive unit.\n\n3. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 one added `@Mapping` line on `toOwnerDto` delegating to the formatter via expression, matching the surrounding mappings. No existing method body grew.\n\nStructural impact stayed minimal: no large method or class was expanded \u2014 behaviour was added as a new small unit plus a single one-line mapping. Tests are green.",
